      "options": {
        "content": "## Eval / Benchmark / Prompt Regressions\nThis dashboard pairs with ragweld's in-product incident feed and summary APIs.\n\n- Run counters cover Eval Analysis, Promptfoo, and Benchmark runs persisted by the API (24h windows).\n- \"Latest\" gauges reflect the most recent persisted run per corpus and reset on API restart until the next run lands.\n- Reranker training evals/promotions are the Learning Ranker training lane, not Eval Analysis runs.\n- Jump into Eval Analysis, Benchmark, and System Prompts with the same corpus/run/prompt-set context.",
